HTTP 429 (including `Error: 429`, a provider `rate_limit_error`, and `Retry failed after 3 attempts`) means that provider's consumption is gone. Do not retry the same model and do not `ask_question`. The `quota-fallback` extension switches automatically along the chain above and continues the turn. The switch is session-only — it does not change the default model. If every configured provider 429s, report that. Unattended mode uses the same automatic switch. Reload PI (`/reload`) after changing this extension.

